    "text": "in terms of the Pass@3 and Pass@5 metrics, ChatGPT's direct gen-eration remains the most effective. The rationale behind this phe-nomenon has been comprehensively discussed in the previous part of this RQ. Compared with the Plan, SCOT and SCOT&amp;KareCoder methods, KareCoder attains a relative improvement of 12.0%, 14.5% and 16.4% on the Pass@1, Pass@3 and Pass@5 metrics, respectively.",
